OL,3,CProgramme listings for WED 18 FEB
OL,4,G1600FComposer of the Week: Rachmaninov
OL,5,     GRachmaninov is forced to embark
OL,6,     Gon a new full-time career as a
OL,7,     Gconcert pianist, through his
OL,8,     Gfirst months as a refugee in
OL,9,     GEurope, and his passage west
OL,10,     Gagain, to New York.
OL,11,G1700FIn Tune
OL,12,     GPetroc Trelawny welcomes folk
OL,13,     Gtrio The Weaving to 80A. He is
OL,14,     Galso joined by pianist Tamara
OL,15,     GStefanovich.
OL,16,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,17,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,18,     Gsoundscape of classical music.
